        <div class="contact-foot"><span>Lyon — 12 rue de la Charité</span><span>Dakar — Almadies</span><span>Réponse sous 48 h</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer><span>© 2026 Atelier Nord</span><span>Instagram · LinkedIn · Behance</span></footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
